@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Rholang NameFlow evidence and mutation boundary
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

package "Immutable analysis" #F8F9FA {
  component "Existing CPG\nAST + DFG + definitions + messages" as CPG #DBE4FF
  component "NameFlow fixed point\nheap worklist + caps" as FLOW #C3FAE8
  component "Level analysis\nchannel projection + SCC" as LEVEL #E5DBFF
  component "Qualified reports\norigins + relations + levels + issues" as REPORT #D3F9D8
}

package "Explicit caller mutation" #FFF9DB {
  component "Validate every endpoint" as VALIDATE #FFE8CC
  component "connect_unique" as CONNECT #FFF3BF
  database "Same node set\n+ NameFlow edges" as OVERLAY #FCC2D7
}

CPG --> FLOW : typed evidence only
FLOW --> LEVEL : fresh channel identities
FLOW --> REPORT
LEVEL --> REPORT
REPORT --> VALIDATE : optional materialization
CPG --> VALIDATE : endpoint membership
VALIDATE --> CONNECT : all valid
CONNECT --> OVERLAY : append 7 kinds

note bottom of VALIDATE #F1F3F5
Unknown source or target returns an error
before the first edge is appended.
end note

legend bottom
|= Colour |= Meaning |
|<#DBE4FF> | existing shared-node CPG |
|<#C3FAE8> | stack-safe provenance closure |
|<#E5DBFF> | level/SCC advisory analysis |
|<#D3F9D8> | immutable qualified result |
|<#FFE8CC> | transactional validation |
|<#FFF3BF> | idempotent mutation primitive |
|<#FCC2D7> | append-only overlay |
endlegend
@enduml
